From: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(autoware_behavior_path_lane_change_module): include fmt/ranges.h for fmt::join

fmt 11 moved fmt::join from fmt/format.h to fmt/ranges.h. fmt/ranges.h
exists in fmt 9 and 10 too, so including it works with all of them.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/autowarefoundation/autoware_universe/commit/0aca0ea44d6ebba9600f753bb561f423591459c8]
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
---
 src/interface.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/interface.cpp b/src/interface.cpp
index 51a9cd6bee..457562ebf2 100644
--- a/src/interface.cpp
+++ b/src/interface.cpp
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@
 #include <autoware_utils/system/time_keeper.hpp>
 
 #include <fmt/format.h>
+#include <fmt/ranges.h>
 
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <limits>
